  "instructions": [
    "Combine Ground Almonds, Chickpea Flour, and Bicarbonate of Soda in a large bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix Coconut Cream, Garlic, Lemon Juice, Salt, and Black Pepper until smooth.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until well combined.",
    "Fold in Fresh Cilantro.",
    "Heat Olive Oil in a deep frying pan over medium heat.",
    "Using a spoon, drop small portions of the mixture into the oil and fry until golden brown, about 3-4 minutes on each side.",
    "Drain the falafel on paper towels and serve hot on a Lazy Susan Spinner.",
    "Serve with your favorite Middle-Eastern dips or sauces, if desired."
